Ethos, Vision & Values
Welcome to our Academy
Empowering students through care and academic ambition.
Welcome to Harris Academy Sutton, a mixed comprehensive situated at the heart of Sutton. We celebrate our diverse student and staff community and our breadth of talents and backgrounds. We opened in 2018 and are now an Ofsted 'Outstanding' Academy with superb GCSE results in 2023, 2024 and 2025 and A-Level results in 2025. We look forward to continuing this success over the coming years.
